{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MusicPics 可將相片快速製作成幻燈片，並加入音樂、文字與背景，完成後可分享至 Instagram 或 TikTok，適合想輕鬆製作相片幻燈片與短片的使用者。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，且使用時不會顯示廣告。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-116.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>濾鏡音樂與文字編輯</h2>\n<p>MusicPics 內置 39 種濾鏡，可將多張相片轉換成幻燈片，並自由調整播放時間與加入音樂。你亦可為畫面加上背景及文字，讓作品更完整，完成後可分享至 Instagram 或 TikTok。整個使用過程不會顯示廣告，操作直接，適合快速製作相片幻燈片與短片。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-113-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-114-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-115-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-116-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-117-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-118-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：MusicPics</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/musicpics/id1447574249?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.648912+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:35:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:10.152499+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.644972+00:00","content_hash":"93daefb28bb597e6830bee51c382eddc81b30991297ada450e0db095011b0c78","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.648912+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}